title Home Assistant 0.3.0: long names everywhere (the dashboard's view titles in the tab bar, card titles, row names, a section, a sensor's and the weather's names, a custom card's type): cut with dots, never over a neighbour; six views, the tab bar scrolls
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO dash-long

wait 1800
shot long-top
check long-top
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 500
shot long-lower
check long-lower
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 500
shot long-end
check long-end
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 800
shot long-tabs
check long-tabs
expect noquit
